SRR4568595	PRJNA351718	SRP092280	SAMN05953329	SRX2309943	Mus musculus	RNA_N1	RNA_N1	Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM2365761: RNA_N1 Mus musculus RNA-Seq	RNA-Seq	TRANSCRIPTOMIC	cDNA	PAIRED	ILLUMINA	Illumina HiSeq 2500	CD8 T cells were FACS-sorted straight into Trizol tube and stored at -80°C until all samples were collected. RNA from sorted cells was extracted using RNeasy mini kit (Qiagen) according to instructions provided by the manufacturer. After ribogreen quantification and quality control of Agilent BioAnalyzer, 6-15 ng of total RNA underwent amplification (12 cycles) using the SMART-seq V4 (Clonetech) ultralow input RNA kit for sequencing. 10ng of amplified cDNA was used to prepare Illumina hiseq libraries with the Kapa DNA library preparation chemistry (Kapa Biosystems) using 8 cycles of PCR. Samples were barcoded and run on a Hiseq 2500 1T in a 50bp/50bp Paired end run, using the TruSeq SBS Kit v3 (Illumina). An average of 51 million paired reads were generated per sample and the percent of mRNA bases was 62.5% on average. 10ng of amplified cDNA was used to prepare Illumina hiseq libraries with the Kapa DNA library preparation chemistry (Kapa Biosystems) using 8 cycles of PCR. Samples were barcoded and run on a Hiseq 2500 1T in a 50bp/50bp Paired end run, using the TruSeq SBS Kit v3 (Illumina).	59623697	5962369700	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR456/005/SRR4568595/SRR4568595_1.fastq.gz;ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR456/005/SRR4568595/SRR4568595_2.fastq.gz	3cb11190ea7534cb79efc01b8235307d;e8e5c9aded3c1192a1b2fca3e46900fa	2225605006;2163076581
