SRR4568537	PRJNA351717	SRP092279	SAMN05953300	SRX2309885	Mus musculus	ATAC_N2	ATAC_N2	Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM2365800: ATAC_N2 Mus musculus OTHER	OTHER	GENOMIC	other	PAIRED	ILLUMINA	Illumina HiSeq 2500	CD8 T cells were FACS-sorted into FCS containing tubes and after sort 10% DMSO were added, mixed and stored at -80°C until all samples were collected. Profiling of Chromatin was performed by ATAC-seq. Cells were thawed and washed in cold PBS and lysed. After cell lysis, transposition happened at 42ºC for 45 min. After purification of the DNA with the MinElute PCR purification kit (Qiagen), material was amplified for 5 cycles. Additional PCR cycles were evaluated by real time PCR. Final product was cleaned by Ampure Beads at a 1.5x ratio. Libraries were sequenced on a Hiseq 2500 1T in a 50bp/50bp Paired end run, using the TruSeq SBS Kit v3 (Illumina). An average of 47x106 paired reads were generated per sample.	61336602	6133660200	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR456/007/SRR4568537/SRR4568537_1.fastq.gz;ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR456/007/SRR4568537/SRR4568537_2.fastq.gz	0b09fdd7cbd8e5d33608fe9592c16b96;b4293e6c09c8727bcf585ca1ffafe03a	1780902603;1866989413
